1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,853
Need twenty quiet minutes, without a tablet?

2
00:00:03,753 --> 00:00:09,373
Hand them this. Big monster truck pictures with thick lines, easy for little hands to color.

3
00:00:10,273 --> 00:00:14,103
And every page has one short sentence, so they practice reading too.

4
00:00:15,003 --> 00:00:19,477
It's the story of Rocco, the little monster truck who learns to make the big jump.

5
00:00:20,377 --> 00:00:24,530
Ages three to six. Best with crayons. Link in bio!

